  "hasDescription": [
    {
      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/4e6b3666-b270-3a11-8a76-1e869c2b2fc7",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          " Informationen :\n\nProdukte: Brot, Gebäck\n\nTage der Öffnung:\n\nTäglich von 7:00 bis 18:00 Uhr\n\nDonnerstag und Sonntag geschlossen\n\nAbholung :\n\nZum Mitnehmen während der Ladenöffnungszeiten\n\nBestellungen:\n\nTelefonische Bestellungen unter 03 21 51 46 90 möglich\n \n\n\ntabelle\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator: \"\\\",\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \"; }\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:black;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:allgemein;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "en": [
          " Information :\n\nProducts: bread, pastries\n\nOpening days:\n\nEvery day from 7am to 6pm\n\nClosed Thursday and Sunday\n\nCollection:\n\nTakeaway during store opening hours\n\nOrdering :\n\nOrder by telephone on 03 21 51 46 90\n \n\n\ntable\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:black;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "it": [
          " Ulteriori informazioni :\n\nProdotti: pane, pasticceria\n\nGiorni di apertura:\n\nTutti i giorni dalle 7.00 alle 18.00\n\nChiuso il giovedì e la domenica\n\nRaccolta:\n\nDa asporto durante gli orari di apertura del negozio\n\nOrdini :\n\nLe ordinazioni possono essere effettuate telefonicamente al numero 03 21 51 46 90\n \n\n\ntabella\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-larghezza-sorgente:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-destra:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolore:nero;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tbordo:nessuno;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "fr": [
          " Informations :\n\nProduits : pain, pâtisseries\n\nJours d'ouverture:\n\nTout les jours de 7h à 18h\n\nFermé le jeudi et le dimanche\n\nRetrait :\n\nÀ emporter aux horaires d'ouverture du magasin\n\nCommandes :\n\nPossibilité de commander par téléphone au  03 21 51 46 90\n \n\n\ntable\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:black;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "nl": [
          " Meer informatie :\n\nProducten: brood, gebak\n\nOpeningsdagen:\n\nElke dag van 7 tot 18 uur\n\nGesloten op donderdag en zondag\n\nOphalen:\n\nAfhalen tijdens openingstijden winkel\n\nBestellen :\n\nBestellingen kunnen telefonisch worden doorgegeven op 03 21 51 46 90\n \n\n\ntabel\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\",\";\n\tmso-displayed-duizend-scheidingsteken:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-hoogtebron:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-breedtebron:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tkleur:zwart;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tverticaal-uitlijnen:onder\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt haarlijn windowtext;}"
        ],
        "es": [
          " Más información :\n\nProductos: pan, bollería\n\nDías de apertura:\n\nTodos los días de 7h a 18h\n\nCerrado los jueves y domingos\n\nRecogida:\n\nPara llevar durante el horario de apertura de la tienda\n\nPedidos :\n\nSe pueden hacer pedidos por teléfono llamando al 03 21 51 46 90\n \n\n\ntabla\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:negro;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborde:ninguno\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
